Muito obrigado.
Boa noite.

589
00:44:20,160 --> 00:44:21,512
Apenas dirija.

590
00:44:28,290 --> 00:44:30,540
Um, seis, nove, zero.

591
00:44:31,750 --> 00:44:33,130
Um, seis, nove, zero.

592
00:44:34,750 --> 00:44:36,300
Dezesseis, noventa.

593
